<title>USA: Schroder Asian Growth to tender for shrs.</title>
<headline>Schroder Asian Growth to tender for shrs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schroder Asian Growth Fund Inc said on Tuesday that the fund is required to conduct a tender offer for its shares in the first quarter of 1997, since the fund's shares have traded at a discount of more than three percent from net asset value during a 12-week period.</p>
<p>The fund's board of directors will meet on February 18, 1997 to decide the terms of the tender offer, Schroder Asian Growth said.</p>
<p>The closed-end fund currently has $270 million in assets invested mostly in Asian equities, the fund said.</p>
</text>
